4. METHODS

4.1 Geometry Update

[ X(t+\Delta t) = X(t) + \Delta t \cdot \mathcal{G}(\mathcal{E}_{\text{QFE}}(\text{Ingest}(t))) + \sigma_X \xi_X(t) ]

(\xi_X(t)) = stochastic noise

(\sigma_X) = noise amplitude

4.2 Reality Node Dynamics

[ \frac{dR_i}{dt} = D_i(X(t), R_i(t)) + \sum_{j \neq i} C_{ij}(R_i(t), R_j(t)) + \sigma_i \xi_i(t) ]

(D_i) = internal ODEs

(C_{ij}) = node‑to‑node coupling

(\xi_i(t)) = stochastic noise

(\sigma_i) = noise amplitude

4.3 Event Detection

[ E(t) = \text{Detect}(R(t), X(t)) ]

Events occur when node states cross thresholds.

4.4 Ledger Update

[ \text{Proof}(E_n) = H(E_n \Vert E_{n-1}) ]

Ledger evolves by appending verified events.

