5. SIMULATION PROTOCOL

5.1 Initialization

Set initial geometry (X(0))

Set initial node states (R(0))

Set initial ledger (L(0))

Choose time step (\Delta t)

Choose total simulation time (T)

5.2 Time‑Stepped Evolution

for t in [0, T]:

    # Geometry update
    X = X + Δt * G( QFE( Ingest(t) ) ) + sigma_X * noise()

    # Reality node update
    for each node i:
        interactions = Σ_j C(i, j, R[i], R[j])
        R[i] = R[i] + Δt * ( D(i, X, R[i]) + interactions ) \
               + sigma_i * noise()

    # Event detection
    events = Detect(R, X)

    # Ledger update
    L = UpdateLedger(L, events)

